WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:49.880
The reason I jumped out the window

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:56.688
Was because the
deep blue sky was so clear

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:02.255
I was still uncertain about
the self I couldn't see

00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:09.065
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:10.204 --> 00:01:15.909
There are things
I can't explain or do well

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.779
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:28.288
So I put my rumpled-up
dream in my pocket

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:35.396
And make a promise to myself
in the sky, ten years from now

00:01:35.396 --> 00:01:41.001
The future I've always
believed in is no mistake

00:01:41.001 --> 00:01:47.341
Because I'm sure I have
stronger feelings than anyone else

00:01:47.341 --> 00:01:51.607
Tenderly

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.959
7th Koyomi Academy Sports Festival

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:05.741
Exciting *
Mina Does Her Best!

00:06:22.849 --> 00:06:25.340
7th Koyomi School Sports Festival

00:16:50.543 --> 00:16:54.877
Red Team
White Team

00:22:23.476 --> 00:22:27.880
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:31.317
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:22:31.317 --> 00:22:36.289
With extraordinary effort
and a little miracle

00:22:36.289 --> 00:22:40.726
I get the feeling that it'll be
rosy and shining soon

00:22:42.628 --> 00:22:47.166
My life in Tokyo is so smooth,
don't I look chic?

00:22:47.166 --> 00:22:50.403
I even did research on
the most trendy clothes

00:22:50.403 --> 00:22:55.007
Now clubs recognize me
and just let me in

00:22:55.007 --> 00:22:59.111
My favorites are my mini-skirts

00:22:59.111 --> 00:23:02.782
It's important to bond
with my friends

00:23:02.782 --> 00:23:06.652
So of course I have a cell phone

00:23:06.652 --> 00:23:14.293
I got it by working hard at a job
that I can't talk about

00:23:14.293 --> 00:23:18.397
I can't lose heart, but
I'm not frantic either

00:23:18.397 --> 00:23:22.034
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:22.034 --> 00:23:24.203
I don't know what I want to do

00:23:24.203 --> 00:23:31.575
It seems these facts of loneliness
keep pouring down

00:23:33.913 --> 00:23:37.983
I don't know why I feel so sad,
I can't even cry

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:41.654
In this wonderful city of dreams,
Tokyo Life

00:23:41.654 --> 00:23:46.492
When I hear "How are you holding up"
in that familiar voice

00:23:46.492 --> 00:23:51.054
It feels like something's tugging
at my heartstrings

00:23:55.301 --> 00:24:20.326
Next Happy Lesson

00:24:20.326 --> 00:24:25.195
Next Happy Lesson
Floating *
Uzuki is an Angel?
